# Review only

When the user asks to review, inspect, diagnose, or check what is going on (`revisar`, `revisá`, `review`, `qué está pasando`), do that and stop.

- Read and explain. Do not edit files, implement a fix, or apply “quick” changes.
- Do not treat a review as permission to patch the issue you found.
- Only change code after an explicit request to implement, fix, or apply the change.
